Act as a senior mobile application developer, UI/UX designer, backend architect, database engineer, and QA specialist.

Upgrade my existing Bingo mobile app into a modern, secure, responsive, and production-ready 75-ball bingo application.

Use the three attached screenshots as the primary visual references. Analyze the existing application before making changes. Preserve working features and the current technology stack wherever possible.

