## 21. Testing and Quality Assurance

Test the following before considering the application complete.

### Authentication tests
- Register a new user.
- Reject invalid registration data.
- Log in successfully.
- Reject incorrect credentials.
- Restore a valid session.
- Log out.
- Prevent unauthorized access.

### Card-generation tests
- Generate one card.
- Generate ten cards.
- Reject zero cards and more than ten cards.
- Validate all column ranges.
- Validate the center FREE position.
- Validate unique numbers within each card.
- Prevent duplicate card-creation requests.
- Restore previously generated cards.
- Apply previous calls to cards generated during an active game.

### Game tests
