- Reject duplicate calls.
- Update the number history.
- Update the 75-number board.
- Synchronize multiple connected clients.
- Reconnect after losing network access.
- Block a card using an authorized account.
- Reject claims for blocked cards.
- Verify a valid Bingo claim.
- Reject an invalid Bingo claim.
- Handle simultaneous winning claims.
- Complete the game correctly.

### UI tests
- Expand and collapse the information card.
- Open and close the card-generation dialog.
- Select each supported card quantity.
- Test scrolling and touch interactions.
- Test the layout on narrow screens.
- Verify button disabled states.
